Kafka Lab – Spring Boot + Apache Kafka
📌 Overview

This project demonstrates an event-driven architecture using:

Spring Boot

Apache Kafka

Confluent Kafka (Docker)

REST API → Producer → Topic → Consumer flow

It showcases how to build an asynchronous communication system using Kafka as a message broker.

🏗 Architecture
Client
   ↓
REST Controller
   ↓
Kafka Producer
   ↓
Kafka Topic
   ↓
Kafka Consumer

The consumer is event-driven and automatically triggered when messages are published to the topic.

