⚠️ Common Issues & Fixes
1️⃣ SerializationException

If you see:

No type information in headers and no default type provided

Solution:

Use StringSerializer/StringDeserializer
OR

Configure JsonDeserializer with trusted packages.

2️⃣ Consumer Not Receiving Messages

Ensure:

@EnableKafka is added

Topic name matches exactly (case-sensitive)

auto-offset-reset=earliest

Correct group-id

